3. Scratch Clone Sabotage Plant
-------------------------------
Plant:
In a scratch clone outside the repo (`$env:TEMP\a2-f2-scratch`), in `enter_user_mode`,
pushed CS = 0x08 (kernel code, RPL 0) and SS = 0x10 (kernel data) instead of 0x3B and 0x33,
running the novad syscall probe in Ring 0.

Planted Run Result:
--- SeaBIOS/selftest: exit=124 serial tail:
    K4_PROC_PROBE novad_exit=Exited(0)
    K4_PROC_PROBE novad_syscall_frame_cs=0x8 cpl=0
      FAIL  ring 3: hardware trap frame CS confirms CPL 3 execution (CS=0x3B, CPL=3) - trap frame CS did not confirm CPL 3
    NOVA_FAULT: vector 6 at rip=0x40000a
