    NOVA: halted.
FAIL (SeaBIOS/selftest) — QEMU stderr (/tmp/a2-f2-scratch/build/qemu-stderr-SeaBIOS-selftest.log):

Conclusion:
When the probe runs in Ring 0, the hardware-saved CS is 0x08 (cpl=0).
The check `novad_cpl == 3 && novad_cs == 0x3B` fails with:
`FAIL ring 3: hardware trap frame CS confirms CPL 3 execution (CS=0x3B, CPL=3) - trap frame CS did not confirm CPL 3`.
Proved: The test checks CPL directly from hardware-pushed CPU trap frame state.
